From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: RCT Screensaver <noreply@example.invalid>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 02:43:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Load window: a park gallery across several folders

A Gallery button in the Load window for parks lists the parks in the user
directory's gallery folder and in folders added to it, with their subfolders,
as a grid. The customize menu adds the shown folder (or, in the gallery, any
folder) and removes added ones; config.ini keeps them as
file_browser_gallery_folders.
